// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — Level 3 (2001–3000字) Unit 12
window.T12_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"ambulance – complaint","cards":[{"w":"ambulance","p":"n.","d":"a specialized emergency vehicle equipped to transport sick or injured people to a hospital","c":"救護車（可數）","s":"When the pedestrian was struck by a speeding car, nearby witnesses immediately called for an ambulance to rush him to the hospital.","t":"當那名行人被超速汽車撞倒時，附近的目擊者立刻呼叫救護車將他火速送往醫院。"},{"w":"approve","p":"v.","d":"to officially agree to, accept, or have a favorable opinion of something","c":"贊成；同意；批准（動詞）","s":"The city council met yesterday to formally approve the construction budget for the modern public library.","t":"雖然她的父母不完全贊成她出國留學的決定，但他們依然在經濟上支持她。市議會昨天開會正式批准了興建現代化公共圖書館的預算。"},{"w":"disapprove","p":"v.","d":"to have an unfavorable opinion of someone or something; to consider wrong","c":"不贊成；反對（動詞）","s":"Many conservative voters openly disapprove of the new taxation policy proposed by the local government.","t":"許多保守派選民公開反對地方政府提出的新稅收政策。"},{"w":"approval","p":"n.","d":"official permission, agreement, or a favorable opinion","c":"贊同；批准；認可（不可數）","s":"The architect cannot begin constructing the high-rise office tower until he receives final approval from the government.","t":"在獲得政府的最終核准／批准之前，建築師無法開始建造高層辦公大樓。"},{"w":"attitude","p":"n.","d":"a settled way of thinking or feeling about someone or something; posture","c":"態度；心態；看法（可數/不可數）","s":"Maintaining a positive attitude in the face of unexpected setbacks is essential for long-term personal success.","t":"在面對意外挫折時保持積極的態度／心態對於個人的長期成功至關重要。"},{"w":"avenue","p":"n.","d":"a broad road in a town or city, or a pathway / method of approach","c":"大道；途徑；手段（可數）","s":"The diplomat promised to explore every possible avenue to achieve a peaceful and lasting solution to the border conflict.","t":"外交官承諾將探尋一切可能的途徑／管道，以達成邊界衝突的和平與持久解決方案。"},{"w":"bravery","p":"n.","d":"courageous behavior or character; the quality of being brave","c":"英勇；勇氣；勇敢（不可數）","s":"The fearless firefighter received a prestigious national medal for his exceptional bravery during the blazing chemical plant explosion.","t":"那位無畏的消防員因在猛烈化學工廠爆炸中展現非凡英勇／勇氣而榮獲國家榮譽勳章。"},{"w":"brave","p":"adj./v.","d":"ready to face danger or pain; to endure unpleasant conditions","c":"勇敢的（形容詞）；勇於面對；冒著（動詞）","s":"Even though heavy snow paralyzed city transit, dedicated postal workers had to brave the freezing elements to deliver letters.","t":"雖然大雪癱瘓了城市交通，敬業的郵政員工仍不得不冒著酷寒天氣遞送信件。"},{"w":"campus","p":"n.","d":"the grounds and buildings of a university or college","c":"校園；校區（可數/不可數）","s":"Living on campus during your freshman year makes it much easier to participate in student clubs and make new friends.","t":"大一期間住在校園內讓參與學生社團和結交新朋友變得容易許多。"},{"w":"clinic","p":"n.","d":"a medical establishment or hospital department where outpatients are given treatment","c":"診所；門診部（可數）","s":"Whenever our neighbors suffer from a mild cold or headache, they visit the local community clinic for immediate treatment.","t":"每當我們的鄰居患上輕微感冒或頭痛時，他們都會前往當地的社區診所尋求即刻治療。"},{"w":"clinical","p":"adj.","d":"relating to the observation and treatment of actual patients rather than theoretical study","c":"臨床的；診所的；客觀冷靜的","s":"Before the new antiviral medication can be sold in pharmacies, it must undergo three rigorous phases of clinical trials.","t":"在新的抗病毒藥物於藥局銷售之前，必須經過三個嚴格階段的臨床試驗。"},{"w":"complain","p":"v.","d":"to express dissatisfaction, pain, or annoyance about something","c":"抱怨；發牢騷；投訴（動詞）","s":"The elderly patient visited the clinic to complain of persistent chest tightness and severe shortness of breath.","t":"那位年邁的病人前往診所訴說／主訴持續的胸悶和嚴重的呼吸急促。"},{"w":"complaint","p":"n.","d":"a statement that something is unsatisfactory; an illness or medical problem","c":"抱怨；抗議；疾症（可數/不可數）","s":"The dissatisfied passenger decided to lodge a formal complaint with the airline after his luggage was lost for three days.","t":"那位不滿的乘客在行李遺失三天後，決定向航空公司提出正式投訴／申訴。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"confirm – harmless","cards":[{"w":"confirm","p":"v.","d":"to establish the truth or correctness of something; to make definite","c":"證實；確認；確定（動詞）","s":"I need to call the dental clinic this afternoon to confirm the exact time of my checkup tomorrow.","t":"我今天下午需要打電話給牙醫診所，以確認我明天檢查的確切時間。"},{"w":"confirmation","p":"n.","d":"the action of confirming something, or proof that verifies a statement","c":"確認；證實；確認函（不可數/可數）","s":"After completing your online ticket purchase, you will immediately receive a booking confirmation by email.","t":"在完成線上購票後，您將會立即透過電子郵件收到預訂確認函。"},{"w":"crash","p":"v.","d":"to collide violently with an obstacle; of a computer to fail suddenly","c":"撞毀；墜毀；（電腦）當機（動詞）","s":"The driver lost control on the icy road and crashed his car into a sturdy concrete wall.","t":"駕駛人在結冰的道路上失去控制，將他的車撞上了一面堅固的混凝土牆。"},{"w":"crash","p":"n.","d":"a violent collision or impact; a sudden economic collapse or loud noise","c":"撞車事故；墜機；暴跌；轟隆聲（可數）","s":"Remarkably, all passengers survived the terrifying plane crash in the remote mountain valley without fatal injuries.","t":"令人驚嘆的是，偏遠山谷那場可怕空難／墜機事故中的所有乘客都奇蹟倖存，沒有人受致命傷。"},{"w":"dinosaur","p":"n.","d":"an extinct prehistoric reptile; an outdated or obsolete person or thing","c":"恐龍；過時落伍的人事物（可數）","s":"In today's digital era of high-speed smartphones, that clunky desktop computer is a complete dinosaur.","t":"在現今高速智慧型手機的數位時代，那台笨重的桌上型電腦簡直是個完全過時落伍的老古董。"},{"w":"enable","p":"v.","d":"to give someone the authority, means, or opportunity to do something","c":"使能夠；使可行；啟動（動詞）","s":"Winning the prestigious full scholarship will enable the talented student to study at Oxford University.","t":"贏得那筆著名的全額獎學金將使那位優秀的學生能夠在牛津大學深造。"},{"w":"fake","p":"adj.","d":"not genuine or authentic; fraudulent or imitation","c":"偽造的；冒牌的；假造的（形容詞）","s":"Social media users should think critically and avoid sharing sensational fake news online.","t":"社群媒體使用者應批判性思考，避免在網路上轉發聳人聽聞的假新聞。"},{"w":"fake","p":"n./v.","d":"a forgery or counterfeit object (n.); to forge or pretend something (v.)","c":"贗品；騙子（名詞）；偽造；假裝（動詞）","s":"The dishonest employee was fired after he tried to fake his manager's signature on the check.","t":"那名不誠實的員工在試圖於支票上偽造主管簽名後遭到解僱。"},{"w":"fashionable","p":"adj.","d":"characteristic of, influenced by, or representing a current popular style","c":"時髦的；流行的；時興的","s":"Paris is widely recognized as the global capital of fashionable clothing and artistic lifestyle.","t":"巴黎被廣泛公認為時髦服飾與藝術生活的世界之都。"},{"w":"fashion","p":"n.","d":"a popular style or practice, especially in clothing, footwear, or lifestyle","c":"流行；時尚；時裝（可數/不可數）","s":"Baggy denim jeans were popular decades ago, but they have recently come back into fashion again.","t":"寬鬆的牛仔褲幾十年前很受歡迎，但最近又重新回歸流行。"},{"w":"governor","p":"n.","d":"the elected executive head of a state in the US, or ruler of a province","c":"州長；總督；主管（可數）","s":"During the severe water drought, the state governor ordered all cities to restrict residential lawn watering.","t":"在嚴重的旱災期間，該州州長下令所有城市限制住宅草坪澆水。"},{"w":"harm","p":"v.","d":"to cause physical injury, material damage, or negative consequences to","c":"傷害；損害；危害（動詞）","s":"Excessive consumption of sugary energy drinks will gradually harm your teeth and digestive organs.","t":"過量飲用含糖能量飲料會逐漸損害你的牙齒和消化器官。"},{"w":"harm","p":"n.","d":"physical injury, especially that which is deliberately inflicted, or damage","c":"傷害；危害；損害（不可數）","s":"During the violent summer typhoon, the farmer moved his cattle into the sturdy barn to keep them out of harm's way.","t":"在猛烈的夏季颱風期間，農夫將牛群移入堅固的牛棚，以確保牠們處於安全避險之地。"},{"w":"harmful","p":"adj.","d":"causing or likely to cause harm; damaging or dangerous","c":"有害的；致害的","s":"Medical research has conclusively proven that breathing secondhand tobacco smoke is highly harmful to children's lungs.","t":"醫學研究已確鑿證實，吸入二手菸對兒童的肺部具有高度危害性／有害的。"},{"w":"harmless","p":"adj.","d":"not able or likely to cause harm, injury, or damage","c":"無害的；無惡意的","s":"Do not scream or run away from that small garden spider because it is completely harmless to humans.","t":"不要對那隻小小的花園蜘蛛尖叫或逃跑，因為它對人類而言是完全無害的。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"jar – pad","cards":[{"w":"jar","p":"n.","d":"a wide-mouthed cylindrical container made typically of glass or pottery","c":"罐子；玻璃罐（可數）","s":"Grandmother preserved fresh strawberries and stored them carefully in a glass jar in the cellar.","t":"祖母醃漬了新鮮草莓，並將它們小心存放在地窖的一個玻璃罐裡。"},{"w":"jaw","p":"n.","d":"each of the upper and lower bony structures in vertebrates forming the framework of the mouth","c":"下巴；頜；顎（可數）","s":"The boxing champion suffered a severe fracture to his lower jaw during the intense title fight.","t":"那位拳擊冠軍在激烈的頭銜爭奪戰中，下顎／下巴遭受嚴重骨折。"},{"w":"learning","p":"n.","d":"the acquisition of knowledge or skills through study, experience, or being taught","c":"學習；學問；學識（不可數）","s":"Modern technological platforms have made online distance learning accessible to ambitious students all over the globe.","t":"現代科技平台讓全球各地有抱負的學生都能輕鬆接觸到線上遠距學習。"},{"w":"lifetime","p":"n./adj.","d":"the duration of a person's life (n.); lasting for the whole of a person's life (adj.)","c":"一生；終生（名詞）；終生的；一輩子的（形容詞）","s":"Visiting Antarctica and observing penguins in their natural polar habitat is truly a once-in-a-lifetime adventure.","t":"造訪南極洲並在天然極地棲息地觀察企鵝，確實是一次一生一次／千載難逢的冒險。"},{"w":"lighthouse","p":"n.","d":"a tower or other structure containing a beacon light to warn or guide ships at sea","c":"燈塔（可數）","s":"The bright rotating beam from the coastal lighthouse guided cargo vessels safely past the treacherous hidden rocks.","t":"來自沿海燈塔明亮的旋轉光束，指引著貨船安全通過危險的暗礁。"},{"w":"meaningful","p":"adj.","d":"having a serious, important, or useful quality or purpose; full of significance","c":"有意義的；深長的；意味深長的","s":"Volunteering every Saturday at the local children's hospital gave the retired professor a truly meaningful life.","t":"每週六在當地兒童醫院做志工，給了那位退休教授一個真正有意義的人生。"},{"w":"meaningless","p":"adj.","d":"having no meaning, significance, or value; futile or pointless","c":"毫無意義的；無關緊要的","s":"Empty political campaign promises are completely meaningless unless elected officials actually pass helpful laws.","t":"空洞的政治競選承諾是完全毫無意義的，除非當選官員實際通過有益的法律。"},{"w":"moist","p":"adj.","d":"slightly wet; damp or humid in a pleasant or fresh way","c":"潮濕的；微濕的；濕潤的","s":"Rich, moist soil in the greenhouse provides the ideal natural environment for growing delicate orchids.","t":"溫室裡肥沃而濕潤的土壤，為培育精緻的蘭花提供了理想的天然環境。"},{"w":"moisture","p":"n.","d":"water or other liquid diffused in a small quantity as vapor, within a solid, or on a surface","c":"水分；濕氣；水氣（不可數）","s":"Applying facial cream immediately after washing helps lock in essential skin moisture throughout the cold day.","t":"洗臉後立即塗抹面霜有助於在寒冷的一整天中鎖住肌膚必要的水分。"},{"w":"pad","p":"n.","d":"a thick piece of soft material used for protection; a block of writing paper","c":"墊子；護具；便條紙本（可數）","s":"The detective pulled a small pad of paper from his coat pocket and quickly wrote down the witness's name.","t":"便衣刑警從外套口袋裡掏出一小本便條紙本，迅速記下了目擊者的名字。"},{"w":"pad","p":"v.","d":"to fill or cover something with a soft material; to lengthen out with unnecessary material","c":"填補；在…加襯墊；虛報（帳目）（動詞）","s":"The dishonest manager was fired immediately after auditors discovered that he had systematically padded his travel expenses.","t":"在審計人員發現那名不誠實的經理系統性地虛報差旅費用後，他立刻被開除了。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"pave – slice","cards":[{"w":"pave","p":"v.","d":"to cover a piece of ground with asphalt, concrete, or stone to make a firm level surface","c":"鋪設；鋪（路）；為…鋪路（動詞）","s":"City construction crews worked throughout the night to pave the busy downtown avenue with smooth asphalt.","t":"市政工程隊整夜工作，用平整的瀝青鋪設繁忙的市中心大道。"},{"w":"pavement","p":"n.","d":"any paved area, especially a sidewalk for pedestrians or the surface of a road","c":"人行道；鋪過的路面（可數/不可數）","s":"Pedestrians are strictly advised to walk safely on the concrete pavement and stay off the busy highway.","t":"當局強烈建議行人安全地走在混凝土人行道上，不要走上繁忙的高速公路。"},{"w":"reliable","p":"adj.","d":"consistently good in quality or performance, and able to be trusted","c":"可靠的；可信賴的；真實可信的","s":"Reputable journalists must thoroughly verify their facts with multiple reliable sources before publishing news stories.","t":"有聲譽的記者在發表新聞報導前，必須透過多個可靠的來源徹底核實事實。"},{"w":"represent","p":"v.","d":"to act or speak officially for someone; to stand for or symbolize something","c":"代表；象徵；代理（動詞）","s":"Athletes wearing proud national team jerseys will represent their country at the forthcoming Summer Olympic Games.","t":"穿著榮耀國家隊球衣的運動員們將在即將舉行的夏季奧林匹克運動會上代表他們的國家。"},{"w":"representative","p":"n./adj.","d":"a person chosen or appointed to act or speak for another (n.); typical of a class (adj.)","c":"代表；代理人（名詞）；有代表性的；典型的（形容詞）","s":"If you have questions about commercial pricing, our friendly customer sales representative will assist you immediately.","t":"如果您對商業定價有任何疑問，我們親切的客戶業務代表將立即為您提供協助。"},{"w":"resource","p":"n.","d":"a stock or supply of money, materials, staff, and other assets drawn on by people","c":"資源；財力；物力（可數，常用複數）","s":"Industrial nations must balance economic development with the conservation of finite planetary natural resources.","t":"工業國家必須在經濟發展與保護有限的地球自然資源之間取得平衡。"},{"w":"resourceful","p":"adj.","d":"having the ability to find quick and clever ways to overcome difficulties","c":"足智多謀的；機敏靈巧的","s":"Stranded in the wilderness after the aircraft engine failed, the resourceful pilot built a sturdy rainproof shelter.","t":"飛機發動機故障後滯留在荒野中，那位足智多謀的飛行員搭建了一個堅固的防雨庇護所。"},{"w":"sack","p":"n.","d":"a large bag made of a strong material used for storing or carrying goods","c":"大麻袋；厚紙袋（可數）","s":"The strong farmer carried a heavy fifty-pound sack of brown rice into the pantry storage room.","t":"身強體壯的農夫扛著一袋沉重的五十磅糙米大麻袋，走進食品儲藏室。"},{"w":"sack","p":"v.","d":"to dismiss someone from employment suddenly","c":"解僱；開除（動詞）","s":"The company decided to sack three senior directors after auditors discovered massive unauthorized budget deficits.","t":"在審計人員發現巨額未經授權的預算虧損後，該公司決定解僱／開除三名資深主管。"},{"w":"scarce","p":"adj.","d":"insufficient for the demand; occurring in small numbers or quantities and difficult to find","c":"稀少的；匱乏的；罕見的","s":"During prolonged dry summer droughts in the desert, clean drinking water becomes dangerously scarce.","t":"在沙漠中漫長乾旱的夏季，乾淨的飲用水變得極度危險地匱乏稀少。"},{"w":"security","p":"n.","d":"the state of being free from danger or threat; safety precautions","c":"安全；安保；保障；保全（不可數）","s":"International travelers must pass through rigorous airport security checkpoints before boarding their overseas flights.","t":"國際旅客在登上海外航班前，必須通過嚴格的機場安全檢查／安檢關卡。"},{"w":"slice","p":"n.","d":"a thin, broad piece of food, such as bread, meat, or cake, cut from a larger portion","c":"一片；薄片；部分（可數）","s":"Many ambitious technology startups are competing aggressively to get their slice of the profitable digital market.","t":"許多雄心勃勃的科技新創公司正在激烈競爭，以期在獲利豐厚的數位市場中分得一杯羹。"},{"w":"slice","p":"v.","d":"to cut something into slices with a sharp knife","c":"切成薄片；切開（動詞）","s":"The chef used an exceptionally sharp Japanese knife to slice the fresh raw salmon thinly.","t":"主廚使用一把異常鋒利的日本刀將新鮮的生鮭魚切成薄片。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"stuff – vacancy","cards":[{"w":"stuff","p":"n.","d":"matter, material, articles, or activities of a specified or unspecified kind (uncountable)","c":"東西；物品；材料；素質（不可數）","s":"The experienced flight instructor praised the young pilot for having the right stuff to handle emergencies.","t":"那位經驗豐富的飛行教官讚揚了那位年輕飛行員具備應對緊急狀況的真材實料／必備素質。"},{"w":"stuff","p":"v.","d":"to fill a receptacle tightly with something; to push something into a small space","c":"塞滿；填進；狼吞虎嚥（動詞）","s":"During the Thanksgiving celebration, grandmother stuffed the roasted turkey with savory breadcrumbs and herbs.","t":"在感恩節慶祝活動期間，祖母用美味的麵包屑和香草填塞烤火雞。"},{"w":"stuffy","p":"adj.","d":"lacking fresh air or ventilation; narrow-minded or overly formal","c":"通風不良的；悶熱的；古板的","s":"Because all the bedroom windows remained shut throughout the afternoon, the room felt uncomfortably hot and stuffy.","t":"因為整個下午臥室的窗戶都緊閉著，房間感覺極不舒服地悶熱且通風不良。"},{"w":"substance","p":"n.","d":"a particular kind of matter with uniform properties; real importance or solidity","c":"物質；實質；本質；實質內容（可數/不可數）","s":"Industrial factories are legally prohibited from discharging any toxic chemical substance into the public river.","t":"法律嚴格禁止工廠向公共河流中排放任何有毒化學物質。"},{"w":"substantial","p":"adj.","d":"of considerable importance, size, or worth; strongly built or made","c":"大量的；可觀的；實質的；堅固的","s":"The technology corporation reported a substantial increase in quarterly sales profits due to its new product.","t":"這家科技公司因推出新產品，公佈了季度銷售利潤的大幅／顯著增長。"},{"w":"tag","p":"n.","d":"a label attached to someone or something for the purpose of identification","c":"標籤；標牌；捉迷藏遊戲（可數）","s":"Before putting your suitcase onto the airport conveyor belt, make sure your luggage tag displays your phone number.","t":"在將行李箱放上機場輸送帶之前，請確保您的行李吊牌上註明了您的電話號碼。"},{"w":"tag","p":"v.","d":"to attach a tag to; to label someone; to mention someone on social media","c":"貼標籤；給…加上標籤；在社群標註（動詞）","s":"Whenever older brother goes to the neighborhood basketball court, his little sister always begs to tag along.","t":"每當哥哥去社區籃球場時，他的小妹妹總是懇求著要跟著去（當跟屁蟲）。"},{"w":"tunnel","p":"n.","d":"an artificial underground passage, especially one dug through a hill or under a river","c":"隧道；地道（可數）","s":"Vehicles traveling between the twin cities pass safely through an illuminated undersea tunnel built beneath the bay.","t":"在兩座城市之間行駛的車輛安全地穿過一條建造在海灣下方的明亮海底隧道。"},{"w":"vacant","p":"adj.","d":"not occupied; empty, available to be used, or showing no expression","c":"空著的；未被佔用的；空缺的；茫然的","s":"During the peak summer holiday festival, there was not a single vacant hotel room available downtown.","t":"在夏季假日慶典的高峰期，市中心沒有一間空著的飯店房間。"},{"w":"vacancy","p":"n.","d":"an unoccupied position or job; an available room in a hotel","c":"空缺；空職；空房（可數）","s":"The neon sign outside the seaside motel flashed 'No vacancy' because all travelers had checked in early.","t":"海濱汽車旅館外的霓虹招牌閃爍著「客滿／無空房」，因為所有旅客都已提前登記入住。"}]}];
